    "task_description": "Please get the current UTC time, retrieve the snapshot of the living room light, and check the payload for the bedroom light. Next, find the discovered lock ticket in the living room and archive it for admin_user_01 via the app with medium priority, using the current UTC time as the title. Finally, take a snapshot of the workspace at /opt/iot/workspace using the lock ticket's ID as the backup name, and send a high-priority email alert to admin_user_01.",
